The direct query was noisy and did not retrieve a paper specifically about a “bone map.” I’ll refine toward the established DXA issue: whether changing ROI/vertebral boundaries or including/excluding bone pixels changes the reported areal BMD. The key distinction is that BMD is calculated from bone mineral content divided by projected area, so changing the analyzed pixels is not merely cosmetic.

